
117:Ichihime
120:???
125:Who's there?!
131:Sakura Matou
132:I'm Sakura Matou, a student at Homurahara Academy.
139:Saber
141:...
148:His name is Shirou Emiya, and we go to the same school.
150:No, I'm in the archery club... Why would you think I'm in the mahjong club?
151:Because nine out of ten people who travel here do so because of mahjong, nyaa!
154:Strangers?
156:They just went and took him away instead.
159:Yeah, based on what I've heard, it's definitely not on you, nyaa.
165:In that case, I'll help too, nyaa!
166:...You're willing to help us, Miss Ichihime?
172:First Day
176:One Han City - Some District
177:Police Station - Entrance
178:Nyaa! That stupid rabbit dumped all the planning stuff on me! Why's there so much annoying paperwork, nyaa...
179:Cut me some slack! Can't organizing a competition be as simple as eating, nyaa?
180:Sorry, I messed up. I didn't expect things to turn out like this...
181:No, Saber, you didn't do anything wrong... But what we should do now...
182:I wonder if there's any way to just bypass all this red tape... Nyaa?!
183:Ah!
184:Geez! Where are you looking, nyaa... Huh? Are you visitors from another city, nyaa?
186:Excuse me... are you a local here?
189:This might seem a bit random, but can I ask you something... What would you do if you encountered a kidnapping situation?
190:What, nyaa?! A kidnapping?!
191:How did it go, nyaa? Did the police confirm it's a kidnapping case?
192:Thank you for the reminder. I didn't think of going to the police at all.
193:Please call me Saber. I am... a companion of sorts to Sakura and the people around her.
194:Just relax, Sakura. I'll know if anything happens to Shirou.
196:I'm getting more confused the more I listen. What's actually going on, nyaa?
197:I'm sorry. I ended up having you come along to the police station without giving you a proper explanation...
198:Saber, my senpai, and I came to this city to do something.
199:I've heard that the game of mahjong is big in this city, but I never thought it would be that popular.
200:We were just checking out the area after we arrived, and out of nowhere, a bunch of strangers closed in on us.
201:Yes, we didn't know any of them. They almost managed to drag me onto their vehicle, and senpai was trying to protect me...
204:Speaking of which, I can't forgive those criminals! What if they scare all the tourists away from One Han City, nyaa?!
205:The police said they would investigate the kidnapping... Sakura, what do you have in mind?
206:...Although the police are helping us, I can't just sit around while senpai is in danger.
209:Don't you worry about it! I'm doing this for One Han City's reputation, nyaa!
211:...How did you know that we're outsiders?
212:I only said that because I don't recognize your uniform. Anyway, welcome to One Han City!
213:Nyaa? Well, it's true that I've lived here for a long time... Oh, you can just call me by my name – I'm Ichihime, nyaa.
214:Hmm, I don't know that school. You must be from a very far place, nyaa.
215:Um, who are you?
216:Well... I guess you're right. Thank you, Saber.
217:Who's this "senpai" you mentioned, nyaa?
218:Since you've come all the way to One Han City, are you members of your school's mahjong club, nyaa?
219:Shirou is in danger because we split up. I was too careless.
220:It's not your fault. I never imagined that something like this would happen...
221:I was in a panic at the time, and then you appeared, Miss Ichihime. Thank you for taking us to the police.
222:You're right. We also need to do our best to find clues ourselves.
223:Searching for a person in a place you don't know is like looking for a needle in a haystack. I can definitely help you since I'm a local, nyaa!
224:Are you sure it'll be okay...? I have no idea what will happen. It might even end up causing you more trouble...
225:Th-That would be great...! Thank you so much...!
